OL,4,C'World class' skatepark gets greenlight
OL,5,GPlans to build a brand-new, state-of-  
OL,6,Gthe-art, concrete skatepark in Kent    
OL,7,Ghave been granted planning permission. 
OL,9,FThanet District Council said the       
OL,10,F"world-class" facility on Ethelbert    
OL,11,FCrescent in Margate's Cliftonville is  
OL,12,Fexpected to open in 2027.              
OL,14,FThe Little Oasis skatepark - which     
OL,15,Fwill be free to use - is set to        
OL,16,F"transform an underused coastal site   
OL,17,Finto a regionally significant,         
OL,18,Finclusive community space", according  
OL,19,Fto the local authority.                
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
