OL,4,CFootball club holds silence for abuse  
OL,5,Cvictims                                
OL,6,GA non-league football club in Kent has 
OL,7,Gheld a minute's silence for victims of 
OL,8,Gdomestic abuse.                        
OL,10,FChatham Town men's team stood for the  
OL,11,Fmark of remembrance ahead of their     
OL,12,FIsthmian Premier League home fixture   
OL,13,Fagainst Maldon & Tiptree on Saturday.  
OL,15,FPlayers wore a White Ribbon sticker on 
OL,16,Ftheir kits in support of a campaign to 
OL,17,Fend violence against women and girls.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
